OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor told she would spend   
OL,4,Atax on 'blowing her lips up'           
OL,6,FFemale politicians say more needs to be
OL,7,Fdone to tackle the rise in misogyny and
OL,8,Fabuse they are facing.                 
OL,10,FRecently elected Northumberland        
OL,11,Fcouncillor Amy Spriggs said she had    
OL,12,Freceived "shocking" abuse online and on
OL,13,Fthe doorstep during her by-election    
OL,14,Fcampaign.                              
OL,16,FAnother councillor in Gateshead said   
OL,17,Fshe had received a death threat this   
OL,18,Fyear.                                  
